Warning [jet.UnreachableState]: `Flow.State.Orphan` is unreachable from every entry transition.
  --> tests/ui_lint/typestate_unreachable.jet:2:26
    |
  2 |     state { Start, Done, Orphan }
    |                          ^^^^^^
 Why: When a state graph has entry transitions, no entry path reaches this state. It may be an unused branch or a state name that is not connected to the protocol.
 Fix: Add an entry or transition path to `Orphan`, or remove it from the declaration.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0153

Warning [jet.RedundantFinalReturn]: An explicit `return` is used on the final value line
  --> tests/ui_lint/typestate_unreachable.jet:6:51
    |
  6 |     #Transition(_, Start) start: fn() -[]> Flow { return Flow{} }
    |                                                   ^^^^^^
 Why: An unadorned expression on the final value line is Jet's implicit return; `return` is for early exits
 Fix: Remove the final `return` and leave the expression as the block tail
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0530

Warning [jet.RedundantFinalReturn]: An explicit `return` is used on the final value line
  --> tests/ui_lint/typestate_unreachable.jet:7:65
    |
  7 |     #Transition(Start, Done) done: fn(self: &&Flow) -[]> Flow { return self }
    |                                                                 ^^^^^^
 Why: An unadorned expression on the final value line is Jet's implicit return; `return` is for early exits
 Fix: Remove the final `return` and leave the expression as the block tail
More: jet-lang.dev/e/L0530
